---
title: yareli's press
layout: main
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-8 gap-2">
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-2 order-1 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg sm:mb-2">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">yareli's press</h2>
      <img class="w-16 sm:w-1/4 float-left mr-2 rounded-lg mb-2 sm:mb-0" src="/content/images/icon.jpg" />
      <p class="type text-sm text-left">
        hi... welcome to my personal blog and website. i write about games, manga,
        personal, et. al. the site is mobile-friendly but is best experienced on
        desktop. please enjoy your stay, and thanks for stopping by.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden sm:block flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">READ ME</h2>
      <p class="type text-sm text-left">
        <b>yareli.</b> 20yo, any/all, black. graphic design undergraduate. depending
        on where u meet me online, i also go by frissyn, berrymyre, and alairaisover.
        <br><br>
        see more on the <a class="link type fg" href="/pages/about/">/about</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-4 order-2 sm:order-3 md:order-2 p-2 border bc bg">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center h-full">
      <div class="flex-none">
        <h1 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">Featured Post</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1">
        {% assign featured = collections.featuredPosts | first %}
        <span class="type text-xs fg">{{ featured.date | date: "%b %d, %Y" }}</span>
        <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold fg mb-2 sm:mb-2">{{ featured.data.title }}</h1>

        <div id="content" class="strip-content">
          {{ featured.content | truncatewords: 125 }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-none mt-2">
        <a class="link text-sm type font-bold uppercase" href="{{ featured.url }}">Read Full Post &gt;&gt;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-2 order-3 sm:order-2 md:order-3 p-2 border bc bg">
    {% render "_includes/posts.liquid", posts: collections.post, limit: 4, url: page.url %}
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto order-last sm:hidden p-2 border bc bg">
    <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">READ ME</h2>
    <p class="type text-sm text-left">
      <b>yareli.</b> 20yo, any/all, black. graphic design undergraduate. depending
      on where u meet me online, i also go by frissyn, berrymyre, and alairaisover.
      <br><br>
      see more on the <a class="link type fg" href="/pages/about/">/about</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>